Subject: [PATCH] v2.1 pre-freeze: all six review items implemented

- silent_break/hard_removal share one target stream per (seed, mode)
- irrelevant targets a link off EVERY optimal route; deterministic mode
  is binary (p->0) and deterministic degradation raises ValueError
- obfuscation draws names from a separate stream (pure relabeling)
- score_route reports valid_finite | silent_broken_edge | illegal_action
  | invalid_route (v2.0 'valid' kept)
- paired_evidence caps episodes (300) with deterministic resampling;
  prompt_view(record, ...) is the only prompt-safe projection: one
  rendering, exact per-pair budget (default 5), no counts/worlds/oracle
- FROZEN Section 7: ecpm_parser.py + parser_fixtures.json +
  test_ecpm_parser.py; INTERFACE.md rewritten for schema 2.1
- seed-7 examples regenerated (schema 2.1, evidence_seed=0);
  ecpm_reply_verification.py added as the regression check

All tests green: test_resource_mdp.py (17) + test_ecpm_parser.py (3).
